<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Lord will silently plan for thee,</l><l>So certainly, He cannot fail!</l><l>Rest on the faithfulness of God,</l><l>In Him thou surely shalt prevail.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Lord will silently plan for thee</l><l>Some wonderful surprise of love.</l><l>Eye hath not seen, nor ear hath heard,</l><l>But it is kept for thee to prove.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Lord will silently plan for thee,</l><l>His purpose He’ll to thee unfold;</l><l>The tangled skein shall shine at last,</l><l>A masterpiece of skill untold.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The Lord will silently plan for thee,</l><l>A happy child kept in His care</l><l>As though no other claimed His love,</l><l>But thou alone to Him wert dear.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
